# Build context of docker/pi-sandbox/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore instead of the
# root .dockerignore). Only what that Dockerfile copies or bind-mounts: the pptx skill tree (fonts,
# requirements, the self-test), this directory, the CA installer, and the CA placeholder / an operator's
# CA file. CA_CERT_FILE must therefore be a .crt or .pem file DIRECTLY under docker/ (docker/tls/, which
# holds private keys, stays out); tests/docker-extra-ca.test.ts checks this file admits it (#77).
*
!default-skills/skills/pptx/
!docker/pi-sandbox/
!docker/install-extra-ca.sh
!docker/extra-ca.crt.example
!docker/*.crt
!docker/*.pem
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.build/
